  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add berbere and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in heavy cream or yogurt, if using.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
